//
// Qwen3.8-27B verify: the dense MLP block, a GDN layer, an attention layer and
// the LM head each against the CPU reference; the fused prefill's last logits
// against it; the prompt prefilled into the 64-layer decode, its greedy tokens
// against the reference; the reference's layers against HF transformers' fed
// the same weights; the shared top-5 gate against Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B in bf16.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, hfweights_fastflowlm_qwen3_8_27b_npu2, hfweights_qwen_qwen3_8_27b
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_peano_verify
// RUN: cd test_peano_verify
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile verify PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: PASS!
// CHECK: PASS!
// CHECK: PASS!
// CHECK: PASS!
// CHECK: tokens: logits cos
// CHECK: PASS!
// CHECK: prefill of {{[0-9]+}} tokens
// CHECK: ' is Paris
// CHECK: PASS!
// CHECK: PASS!
// CHECK: [verify] PASS
